bundled; they are downloaded at runtime from alphacephei.com (or a mirror) under their own
licenses.

Screenshots (docs/screenshots). The posters, stills and titles in the rows are published by the
apps installed on the device (through the Android TV provider): "continue watching" and the
"Кино" row by a small demo app with posters and stills from The Movie Database (TMDB), the other
rows by the apps they are named after. They belong to their rights holders. The wallpaper on the
home screen is Bing's photo of the day and belongs to its author; the screensaver shows
"Leigh-on-Sea beach sunset" by Joshua Fuller, CC0 1.0, from Wikimedia Commons (originally Unsplash,
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Leigh-on-Sea_beach_sunset_(Unsplash).jpg). The app tiles show the names and banners of those apps, which
belong to their owners. All of them are shown as a launcher shows them; Lumbina is not
affiliated with any of them, nor with TMDB.

